          <td><span class="postbody">Living the high lifestyle in West Freeport.
<br />

<br />
Entry to our humble abode.
<br />
<img src="http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_entry.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_entry.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
The front room which is mainly our store. Not sure where Diz got the giant cigar stuck in a rock.
<br />
<img src="http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_storefront.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_storefront.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
This is where we sell our loot, harvested items, and even some crafted items.
<br />
<img src="http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_storecounter.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_storecounter.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
This is the entry to our bedroom.  Ahh the chest of skulls gives the place such a warm feeling.
<br />
<img src="http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_bedroomentry.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_bedroomentry.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
View 1 of our bedroom.  A little big for 2 gnomes...so we bought a frog and cat. (Cat not seen due to its constant falling through floor.)
<br />
<img src="http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_bedroom1.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_bedroom1.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
Second shot of bedroom from the bed.
<br />
<img src="http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_bedroom2.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/home_bedroom2.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
This is how Jooko looked once he found out how much money was spent on the giant cigar in rock.
<br />
<img src="http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/jooko_mad.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://www.dalharen.com/images/screenshots/jooko_mad.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
We are now housed at the inn in West Freeport.  I think we have gotten all the guildies added to the access list.  Just enter...take a left...and then another left and we are in the first door on the left.
<br />

<br />
Ed</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
